  "question": {
    "text": "<p>As shown in the figure, a long straight conductor with semicircular arc of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is carrying current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></math>. The magnitude of the magnetic field. at the center <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> of the arc is: (The permeability of the vacuum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>NA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> )</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0066_01d60c8451d7.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 130px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
